<title>LEBANON: No agreement on Malaysian car plant in Lebanon.</title>
<headline>No agreement on Malaysian car plant in Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian Prime Minister Mahathir Mohamad said on Wednesday he had discussed the possibility of establishing a Malaysian car plant in Lebanon but no agreement had been reached.</p>
<p>&quot;We have not agreed on anything yet. We talked loosely about it but there is no agreement,&quot; Mahathir told a news conference at the end of his three-day trip to Lebanon.</p>
<p>Malaysian car maker Perusahaan Otomobil Nasional BHd (Proton) said in a statement in Kuala Lumpur on Tuesday that it would sign an agreement with a Lebanese company to make Lebanon its 44th export market.</p>
</text>
